  "requests": [
    {
      "id": "qr_generate",
      "purpose": "生成登录二维码",
      "condition": "此路线走到这一步时",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://passport.bilibili.com/x/passport-login/web/qrcode/generate",
        "headers": {
          "Accept": "application/json, text/plain, */*",
          "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9",
          "Cache-Control": "no-cache",
          "Pragma": "no-cache",
          "Referer": "https://passport.bilibili.com/login",
          "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/124.0.0.0 Safari/537.36",
          "Cookie": "{{qr_cookie_header_if_nonempty}}"
        },
        "query": {},
        "body": null,
        "wbi_signed": false
      },
      "response": {
        "format": "json",
        "success": "HTTP 成功、根 code=0 且 data.qrcode_key/data.url 非空",
        "extract": {
          "qrcode_key": "$.data.qrcode_key",
          "qr_content": "$.data.url"
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        "客户端开始新一轮登录时清空二维码 Cookie 容器。返回 url 在本地生成二维码，不是音频地址。",
        "每次响应的 Set-Cookie 都要合并到 qr_cookie_header；删除标记会移除 Cookie。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "modules/platform/src/main/java/moe/ouom/neriplayer/platform/bilibili/api/auth/BiliQrLoginClient.kt",
          "line": 45,
          "symbol_or_text": "fun createSession",
          "url": "https://github.com/f1515x/NeriPlayer/blob/3e1abcb704a76a3cd211878c7303d4058866c4d4/modules/platform/src/main/java/moe/ouom/neriplayer/platform/bilibili/api/auth/BiliQrLoginClient.kt#L45"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "qr_poll",
      "purpose": "等待扫码和确认",
      "condition": "此路线走到这一步时",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://passport.bilibili.com/x/passport-login/web/qrcode/poll",
        "headers": {
          "Accept": "application/json, text/plain, */*",
          "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9",
          "Cache-Control": "no-cache",
          "Pragma": "no-cache",
          "Referer": "https://passport.bilibili.com/login",
          "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/124.0.0.0 Safari/537.36",
          "Cookie": "{{qr_cookie_header_if_nonempty}}"
        },
        "query": {
          "qrcode_key": "{{qrcode_key}}"
        },
        "body": null,
        "wbi_signed": false
      },
      "response": {
        "format": "json",
        "success": "根 code=0 后再看 data.code；data.code=0 才是确认登录",
        "extract": {
          "login_status": "$.data.code",
          "login_message": "$.data.message",
          "cookies": "HTTP Set-Cookie，合并到二维码会话容器"
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        "86101=未扫描，86090=已扫描待确认，86038=过期，0=确认成功。未扫描和待确认时每隔 1500ms 再问一次。",
        "DNS、连接或超时错误最多尝试 3 次，间隔 100ms；不是所有 HTTP/业务错误都重试。",
        "成功后必须有非空 SESSDATA。Cookie 来自响应头，不是从 data.url 解析；refresh_token 未在此实现中保存或使用。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "modules/platform/src/main/java/moe/ouom/neriplayer/platform/bilibili/api/auth/BiliQrLoginClient.kt",
          "line": 62,
          "symbol_or_text": "fun checkLogin",
