    {
      "id": "validate_login",
      "purpose": "检查已存登录态是否仍可用",
      "condition": "显式调用此登录检查方法时；扫码保存 Cookie 后并没有自动调用",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.bilibili.com/x/web-interface/nav",
        "headers": {
          "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/124.0.0.0 Safari/537.36",
          "Referer": "https://www.bilibili.com",
          "Cookie": "{{stored_cookie_header}}"
        },
        "query": {},
        "body": null,
        "wbi_signed": false
      },
      "response": {
        "format": "json",
        "success": "HTTP 成功、code=0、data.isLogin=true、data.mid>0",
        "extract": {
          "mid": "$.data.mid",
          "is_login": "$.data.isLogin"
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        "缺 SESSDATA 直接返回 false，不发请求；网络异常返回 null，不能当成未登录。",
        "本地 Cookie 健康判断只检查 SESSDATA，不代表服务端确认；nav 登录检查与取 WBI key 是不同用途。"
      ],
      "sources": [
