      },
      "response": {
        "format": "json",
        "success": "HTTP 成功且 data.wbi_img.img_url/sub_url 非空",
        "extract": {
          "img_url": "$.data.wbi_img.img_url",
          "sub_url": "$.data.wbi_img.sub_url"
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        "此方法不要求根 code=0 或 isLogin=true，只读取 key URL；nav 取 key 不是登录成功判断。",
        "先取得 effective cookies；空保存记录可能触发 anonymous_fingerprint。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "modules/platform/src/main/java/moe/ouom/neriplayer/platform/bilibili/api/client/BiliClient.kt",
