    {
      "id": "wbi_ticket",
      "purpose": "nav 取 key 失败时换备用方式",
      "condition": "fetchMixinKeyFromNav 抛异常",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.bilibili.com/bapis/bilibili.api.ticket.v1.Ticket/GenWebTicket",
        "headers": {
          "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:109.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/115.0"
        },
        "query": {
          "key_id": "ec02",
          "hexsign": "{{hmac_sha256_hex_key_XgwSnGZ1p_message_ts_plus_unix_seconds}}",
          "context[ts]": "{{unix_seconds}}"
        },
        "body": {
          "encoding": "empty",
          "value": ""
        },
        "wbi_signed": false,
        "optional_query": {
          "csrf": "{{bili_jct_if_nonempty}}"
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "format": "json",
        "success": "HTTP 成功且 data.nav.img/sub 非空",
        "extract": {
          "img_url": "$.data.nav.img",
          "sub_url": "$.data.nav.sub"
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        "所有参数在 URL 查询串里，POST body 是空字节数组，没有 JSON body。",
        "effective cookies 中 bili_jct 非空时额外加入查询参数 csrf；源码不发送 Cookie 或 Referer 请求头。",
        "HMAC 消息为字符串 ts 加当前秒数，key 为源码协议常量 XgwSnGZ1p；不是用户凭据。"
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "modules/platform/src/main/java/moe/ouom/neriplayer/platform/bilibili/api/client/BiliClient.kt",
          "line": 1163,
          "symbol_or_text": "private suspend fun fetchMixinKeyFromTicket",
